10. Unpivot Data

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import expr

df.selectExpr(
"employee_id",
"stack(3,'Jan',Jan,'Feb',Feb,'Mar',Mar) as (month,sales)"
)

SQL:

SELECT employee_id,
       'Jan' month,
       Jan sales
FROM sales

UNION ALL

SELECT employee_id,
       'Feb',
       Feb
FROM sales;
